# Conformance probe pack for `with` (spec 0.18, ruling 22) on the `text` wire
# (spec 0.10). Public. No kinds. Default delimiter ",", no start, no checksum.
#
#   field 0   x
#   field 1   y with x: when x is not held the field is written empty, and
#             it still counts for the number of fields (step 4 of 0.10)
#   field 2   z with y, optional: when y is not held the field is empty and,
#             being last and optional, removed (step 5 of 0.10)
#
# The companion keys are checked on the entity: y held from the input holds
# for z even when y's own line is suppressed (ruling 2).
format  conformance-cond-text
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    text
field   probe.x   0   int
field   probe.y   1   int  with probe.x
field   probe.z   2   int  optional  with probe.y
